Maintainer: Francesco Barile <francesco.barile@unimib.it>
Description: Provides Bayesian methods for modeling graph-valued data
    through generalized centered Erdős–Rényi models. The package
    implements Bayesian inference and computational procedures for
    analyzing network data, including the computation of graph
    summaries such as the clustering coefficient.
